OL,3,GNEWSANew council leader installed after
OL,4,Ano- confidence vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey borough council has chosen to
OL,7,Freplace its leader months before the
OL,8,Fcouncil's abolition next spring.
OL,10,FSpelthorne Group councillor Joanne
OL,11,FSexton will now lead Spelthorne Borough
OL,12,FCouncil until next April, replacing
OL,13,FGreg Neall who faced a no-confidence
OL,14,Fmotion on Thursday.
OL,16,FSexton, who previously led the council
OL,17,Ffrom May 2023 to May 2026, will be in
OL,18,Fcharge until it is absorbed into the
OL,19,Fnewly formed West Surrey Council,
OL,20,Fcreated as part of local government
OL,21,Freorganisation reforms.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
