OL,3,GNEWSANew council leader installed after
OL,4,Ano- confidence vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe no-confidence motion was tabled by
OL,7,Fanother former council leader, John
OL,8,FBoughtflower, who sought to return to
OL,9,Fthe post following Neall's removal from
OL,10,Foffice.
